OL,3,GNEWSACustomers critical after being
OL,4,Aleft without water
OL,5,
OL,6,FA water company says it is planning to
OL,7,Fset up a water station and deliver
OL,8,Fbottled water to vulnerable customers
OL,9,Fafter residents reported being left
OL,10,Fwithout water for hours.
OL,12,FA spokesperson for South West Water
OL,13,Fsaid some customers in the
OL,14,FBuckfastleigh area were experiencing
OL,15,Flow water pressure and temporary loss
OL,16,Fof supply after "issues with equipment"
OL,17,Fat one of its treatment works.
OL,19,FThey said resolving the original issue
OL,20,Fhad lead to air pockets forming within
OL,21,Fthe network which had affected
OL,22,Fsupplies.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
