OL,3,GNEWSACustomers critical after being
OL,4,Aleft without water
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth West Water said on Friday evening
OL,7,Fa bottled water station had been set up
OL,8,Fat Meadowbrook Car Park in Dartington
OL,9,Fwhich would be open until 22:00 GMT.
